Every file in this directory is licensed MIT, unlike the rest of the Collins
test suite (GPL-3.0-or-later): the synthetic scenarios (scenarios.py) and
their golden (synthetic.golden.json), which are Collins' own measurements of
what VTE 0.84 shows for each stream, and the recorded streams of a Claude
Code 2.1.288 session (*.bin), the offsets their scenarios end at
(*.marks.json) and what VTE showed at each (*.golden.json). They are the
measurements the terminal contract of the service API (docs/api/terminal.md)
rests on, published so that another implementation of the API can be held
to the same readings. The data files cannot carry a header, so this file
is theirs; scenarios.py carries its own SPDX tag.

